{"title":"Langfristige Stressreaktion","puid":"c-bio-9/g5e5ji","path":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/level-03","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","keyboardLayout":"standardDE","voice":"m3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"multipleChoiceText","instruction":{"text":"Lies den Text und beantworte die Frage.","speaker":true},"soundMode":"a","lsg":{"width":150},"shuffleButtons":true,"atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/01_Def-Stress.lsg"},{"title":"Langfristige Stressreaktion"},{"text":"Im Gegensatz zu kurzfristigem Stress, der durch akute Situationen ausgelöst wird und vorübergehend ist, <span class=0>entsteht langfristiger Stress durch anhaltende Belastungen</span>. Die langfristige Stressreaktion hilft dem Körper, sich an diese dauerhafte Belastung anzupassen und sie über einen längeren Zeitraum zu bewältigen.","speaker":true},{"a":"Wann wird die langfristige Stressreaktion ausgelöst?","b":["++Wenn Belastungen länger anhalten.","Wenn Belastungen kurz anhalten."],"highlightSpanClass":"0"}]},{"trainer":"imageButtons","instruction":{"text":"Wähle Stressoren aus, die <b>langfristigen Stress</b> auslösen können.","speaker":true},"lsg":{"width":130},"atoms":{"b":[{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_imageButtons-Schlafmangel.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_imageButtons-Verlust.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_imageButtons-Ueberarbeitung.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_imageButtons-Pruefung.lsg"}],"feedback":{"wrong":{"text":"Bei einer Prüfung handelt es sich um einen kurzfristigen Stressor.","speaker":true,"autoplay":false}}}},{"trainer":"contentPlayer","instruction":{"text":"Schaue dir den körperlichen Ablauf der <b>langfristigen Stressreaktion</b> an.","speaker":true},"lsg":{"width":350},"voice":"f5_2025","atoms":[{"text":"Der <b>Hypothalamus</b> im Gehirn erkennt über Nervenimpulse anhaltenden Stress.","speaker":true,"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-0.lsg","continueButton":true},{"text":"Der Hypothalamus schüttet das Hormon <b>CRH</b> (Corticotropin-Releasing-Hormon) aus.","sound":"Der Hypothalamus schüttet das Hormon CRH,  Corticotropin-Releasing-Hormon, aus.","lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-1-copy.lsg","continueButton":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-2-copy.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-3-copy.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":true},{"text":"CRH wirkt auf die <b>Hirnanhangdrüse</b> (Hypophyse).","sound":"CRH wirkt auf die Hirnanhangdrüse, Hypophyse.","lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-4-copy.lsg","continueButton":true},{"text":"Die Hirnanhangdrüse setzt daraufhin das Hormon <b>ACTH</b> (adrenocorticotropes Hormon) ins Blut frei.","sound":"Die Hirnanhangdrüse setzt daraufhin das Hormon ACTH, Adrenocorticotropes Hormon, ins Blut frei.","lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-5-copy.lsg","continueButton":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-6-copy.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-7-copy.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":true},{"text":"Über die Blutgefäße erreicht ACTH die <b>Nebennierenrinde</b>.","speaker":true,"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-8.lsg","continueButton":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-9.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-10.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-11.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-12.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-13.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-14.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":true},{"text":"ACTH regt die Nebennierenrinde an, das Hormon <b>Cortisol</b> ins Blut auszuschütten.","speaker":true,"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-15-copy.lsg","continueButton":true},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-16-copy.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":false},{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_cP-17-copy.lsg","duration":"500ms","continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"lsg","gapMode":"buttons","instruction":{"text":"Wiederhole den <b>Ablauf der langfristigen Stressreaktion</b>, indem du die beteiligten Hormone korrekt einordnest.","speaker":true},"shuffleButtons":true,"shuffleAtoms":false,"combineButtons":true,"removeCorrectButton":true,"soundMode":"b","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-bio-9/topic-05-informationssysteme-mensch/block-08-stress/lsg/03_Schaubild-Hormonwirkung-copy.lsg","width":350},"gapLength":9,"hint":{"text":"CRH = Corticotropin-Releasing-Hormon <br>ACTH = adrenocorticotropes Hormon","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"atoms":[{"id":"input1","b":"((CRH))","voice":"m2Poly"},{"id":"input2","b":"((ACTH))","voice":"m2Poly"},{"id":"input3","b":"((Cortisol))","voice":"m2Poly"}]},{"trainer":"kidPairs","finishButton":true,